flowchart TD

    A([handleRoot]) --> B[Load graphMinY and graphMaxY]
    B --> C[Set HTTP Content-Type header]
    C --> D[Calculate elapsed time since last packet]
    D --> E[Create HTML page]
    E --> F[Add page header, auto refresh, CSS]
    F --> G[Add Config link and temperature table header]

    G --> H{{For each sensor 0..13}}

    H --> I[Determine temperature string<br/>Temp or N/A]
    I --> J{Temperature detected?}

    J -- Yes --> K[Display position normally<br/>Temperature in bold]
    J -- No --> L[Display position in red<br/>Temperature normal]

    K --> M{More sensors?}
    L --> M
    M -- Yes --> H
    M -- No --> N[Append sender/receiver status]

    N --> O[Sender Battery]
    O --> P[Sender Version]
    P --> Q[Sender CPU Temperature]
    Q --> R[Receiver Version]
    R --> S[Receiver CPU Temperature]
    S --> T[Water Detection Status]
    T --> U[HTTP Status Code]
    U --> V[Sleep Timer]

    V --> W[Create HTML5 Canvas]

    W --> X[Generate JavaScript]
    X --> Y[Initialize Canvas]
    Y --> Z[Set graph limits]

    Z --> AA{{For sensors 1..13}}

    AA --> AB{ROM assigned AND valid temperature?}
    AB -- Yes --> AC[Add point to graph array]
    AB -- No --> AD[Skip point]

    AC --> AE{More sensors?}
    AD --> AE
    AE -- Yes --> AA
    AE -- No --> AF[Draw graph axes]

    AF --> AG[Draw Y-axis labels]
    AG --> AH[Draw X-axis labels]
    AH --> AI[Draw graph titles]

    AI --> AJ{Any graph points?}

    AJ -- Yes --> AK[Draw temperature curve<br/>and markers]
    AJ -- No --> AL[Skip plotting]

    AK --> AM[Close HTML]
    AL --> AM

    AM --> AN[Send HTTP 200 response]
    AN --> AO([End])
